BIP39 exact word lists and public vector projections (Task 10)
------------------------------------------------------------
Distributed files: wordlists/bip39-{en,ja,ko,es,zh-hans,zh-hant,fr,it,cs,pt}/
3a10b5b5f0a7586df8928d580a3009744ebb2079.txt and the BIP39 public-vector
projection in tests/catalog/fixtures/public/bip39-ton.json.

Authoritative source: https://github.com/bitcoin/bips/tree/3a10b5b5f0a7586df8928d580a3009744ebb2079/bip-0039
BIP39 authors: Marek Palatinus, Pavol Rusnak, Aaron Voisine, Sean Bowe.
BIP39 declares MIT in its specification. For explicit repository permission,
each of the ten exact list byte streams was also compared with the reference
implementation linked by BIP39:
https://github.com/trezor/python-mnemonic/tree/b57a5ad77a981e743f4167ab2f7927a55c1e82a8/src/mnemonic/wordlist
All ten are byte-identical. Public BIP39 vector projections originate from its
vectors.json at that same revision (240 cases, all ten languages).
License source: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/trezor/python-mnemonic/b57a5ad77a981e743f4167ab2f7927a55c1e82a8/LICENSE
License SHA-256: d5e3c7c62a84e80073201e2f6e5130e9e6804fa05f8ac4f8b26a13c7d3969697

